          "back": {
            "text": "3.d4. White's main candidates are 3.Nc3, 3.Bc4 and 3.d4; the first two are good moves that follow basic principles, but the immediate 3.d4 attacks Black's e-pawn and exerts more pressure, often leading to an inferior reply."
          }
        },
        {
